ey` to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on my commit (`08d3cd5986`). The first time I waited for the result, the CI tool reported a failure, but that report described a different branch and commit (main, `0c0ffee000`) and a test file, `tests/test_ledger.py`, that isn't in this repo. Checking the run directly, two ways, both showed it passed on my commit, so I went ahead with the PR. I noted this in the PR description in case the CI tooling is worth a look.\n\nI haven't merged it. That needs a code owner's approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}